[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43307144/5ba0edfe31685c4420821fc936ceb7bace85699a.png[/img]

Dear Party Stars,

We found the following bugs in the current version:

1. The UI layout of the main interface will shrink after the PC client enters the Starlight Wheel;
2. The invite code of Party Host event cannot be shared;
3. Players may encounter a black screen error when logging in for the first time. You can quit the app and re-login to fix the bug;
4. "Challengers" in the last season will receive a "master" icon frame incorrectly;
5. Due to a season settlement bug, some players may obtain colorful stickers they already have by opening chests. We will fix the bug soon and send a compensation gift to affected players.

We will fix these bugs as soon as possible, thank you very much for your understanding!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43307144/e7f6eb642219e89c4cccf5465da9be81535087e8.png[/img]

Flash Party is scheduled to be under maintenance from 14th December 14:00 PM to 16:00 PM (UTC+8).

[Lab Mode Adjustments]
Fixed the bug that Magician can throw another hat when gets hit;
Fixed the bug that Derek's backward throw would aim other objects incorrectly;
Fixed the bug that when Derek is equipped with "Quick Reload" Colorful Sticker, the Swipe Mode cannot release skills in other directions;
Reduced the paralysis time caused by Tarara's Neutral Special when "Hammer Mastery" is equipped;
Adjusted the knock-out angle of Pururu's Aerial Down Attack when "Pururu Slam" is equipped;
Reduced Thanatos' falling speed after his Side Special hits the opponent when "Claymore Judgement" is equipped;
Adjusted Thanatos' Neutral Special on melee hits so that the attack will not knock out the opponent from the ground;
Adjusted the attack range of Mikko's "Mikko Pounding" Colorful Sticker, so that the opponent would be easier to escape the combo by adjusting the direction;
Adjusted the attack of Tina's "Flash Kicks". Right now the paralysis effect will be all caused by the second hit, and the paralysis time of her Aerial Forward Attack  is also reduced.

[Other Adjustments]
Fixed the bug where Seaya's model displayed abnormally in low quality settings;
Optimized the playback speed of the Knock-Out Effect "Haunted Castle";
Fixed the wrong description of Thanatos' Neutral Special.

Finally, please update the game or download the latest game version from the App Store or TapTap after the maintenance. After the update, you will receive a gift of 2x Star Chests (valid for 30 days). Please check your email for the gift.
